node_modules/
# Not committed on purpose. The only dependency is spytial-core, declared as a
# caret range so it floats on the peer major — the same way every CDN tag here
# floats (see test/pins.test.mjs). A lockfile would freeze the conformance suite
# against one patch of core, which is exactly the drift it exists to catch: CI
# resolves the newest 4.x on every run, so a core release that changes what a
# spec entails fails a build rather than surfacing in someone's diagram.
package-lock.json
.DS_Store
*.log
dist/
.cache/
